Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: TestNG bridge for conformance results and Inji
 Verify rig integration

apitest-commons-conformance reads results.json v1, runs the conformance
runner with a time limit when asked, and maps each module verdict to a
TestNG pass, failure, Known Issue or Ignored row in the stock
EmailableReport. The Inji Verify rig gains OpenIDConformanceTest, a
conformance master suite and ConformanceRigRunner, which exits 1 when a
row fails. testrigs/pom.xml aggregates the bridge and both rigs.

Signed-off-by: Paradox_73 <kanavbhardwaj86412a@gmail.com>
